#: rc.cpp:1
msgid "Invitation - Desktop Sharing"
msgstr "Uitnodiging - Werkskerm Deeling"

#: rc.cpp:3 rc.cpp:4 rc.cpp:32 rc.cpp:33 rc.cpp:47 rc.cpp:48
msgid "Closes this window."
msgstr "Gaan toe hierdie venster."

#: rc.cpp:5
msgid "Welcome to KDE Desktop Sharing"
msgstr "Welkom na Kde Werkskerm Deeling"

#: rc.cpp:6
msgid ""
"KDE Desktop Sharing allows you to invite somebody at a remote location to "
"watch and possibly control your desktop. To invite somebody using email, "
"press the 'Invite via Email' button. If you would like to tell somebody how "
"to login personally, or via telephone, use the 'Create Personal Invitation' "
"button. To see existing invitations or cancel them use the 'Manage "
"Invitations' button."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:7
msgid "Create &Personal Invitation..."
msgstr "Skep Persoonlike Uitnodiging..."

#: rc.cpp:9
msgid ""
"Will create a new invitation and display it to you. Use this option if you "
"want to invite somebody personally."
msgstr ""
"Sal skep 'n nuwe uitnodiging en vertoon dit na jy. Gebruik hierdie opsie as "
"jy wil hê na nooi iemand persoonlik."

#: rc.cpp:10
msgid "Invite via &Email..."
msgstr "Nooi deur middel van E-pos..."

#: rc.cpp:11
msgid ""
"This button will start your email application with a pre-configured text "
"that explains to the recipient how to connect to your computer. "
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:12
msgid "&Manage Invitations..."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:13
msgid "Use this button to see your invitations or to cancel them."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:14
msgid "Manage Invitations - Desktop Sharing"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:15
msgid "Created"
msgstr "Geskep"

#: rc.cpp:16
msgid "Expiration"
msgstr "Vertreking"

#: rc.cpp:18
msgid ""
"Displays the open invitations. Use the buttons on the right to delete them "
"or create a new invitation."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:19
msgid "New &Personal Invitation..."
msgstr "Nuwe Persoonlike Uitnodiging..."

#: rc.cpp:20
msgid "Create a new personal invitation..."
msgstr "Skep 'n nuwe persoonlike uitnodiging..."

#: rc.cpp:21
msgid "Click this button to create a new personal invitation."
msgstr "Kliek hierdie knoppie na skep 'n nuwe persoonlike uitnodiging."

#: rc.cpp:22
msgid "&New Email Invitation..."
msgstr "Nuwe E-pos Uitnodiging..."

#: rc.cpp:23
msgid "Send a new invitation via email..."
msgstr "Stuur 'n nuwe uitnodiging deur middel van e-pos..."

#: rc.cpp:24
msgid "Click this button to send a new invitation via email."
msgstr "Kliek hierdie knoppie na stuur 'n nuwe uitnodiging deur middel van e-pos."

#: rc.cpp:26
msgid "Delete all invitations"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:27
msgid "Deletes all open invitations."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:29
msgid "Delete the selected invitation"
msgstr "Uitvee die gekose uitnodiging"

#: rc.cpp:30
msgid ""
"Delete the selected invitation. The invited person will not be able to "
"connect using this invitation anymore."
msgstr ""
"Uitvee die gekose uitnodiging. die uitgenooi persoon sal nie wees in staat "
"na konnekteer te gebruik hierdie uitnodiging meer."

#: rc.cpp:34
msgid "New Connection - Desktop Sharing"
msgstr "Nuwe Verbinding - Werkskerm Deeling"

#: rc.cpp:35
msgid "&Accept Connection"
msgstr "Aanvaar Verbinding"

#: rc.cpp:36
msgid ""
"This button grants the request. The remote user can now watch your desktop "
"and, if you selected it above, control your computer."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie knoppie gee die versoek. die afgeleë gebruiker kan nou waarneem jou "
"werkskerm en, as jy gekose dit boonste, kontrole jou rekenaar."

#: rc.cpp:37
msgid "&Refuse Connection"
msgstr "Weier Verbinding"

#: rc.cpp:38
msgid ""
"This button will refuse the connection. You should choose this unless you "
"trust the requesting user."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie knoppie sal weier die verbinding. Jy moet kies Hierdie tensy Jy "
"vertrou die versoek gebruiker."

#: rc.cpp:39
msgid "Attention"
msgstr "Aandag"

#: rc.cpp:40
msgid ""
"Somebody is requesting a RFB (VNC) connection to your computer. \n"
"Granting this will allow them to see everything on your screen and, if the "
"option below is enabled, be able to control it. Refuse the connection unless "
"you trust the person."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:41
msgid "Remote system:"
msgstr "Afgeleë stelsel:"

#: rc.cpp:42
msgid "123.234.123.234"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:43
msgid "Allow remote user to &control keyboard and mouse"
msgstr "Toelaat afgeleë gebruiker na kontrole sleutelbord en muis"

#: rc.cpp:44
msgid ""
"If you turn this option on, the remote user can enter keystrokes and use "
"your mouse pointer. This gives them full control over your computer, so be "
"careful. When the option is disabled the remote user can only watch your "
"screen."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:45
msgid "Personal Invitation - Desktop Sharing"
msgstr "Persoonlike Uitnodiging - Werkskerm Deeling"

#: rc.cpp:49
msgid "Personal Invitation"
msgstr "Persoonlike Uitnodiging"

#: rc.cpp:50
msgid ""
"In order to connect to your computer, the other person can use any VNC "
"client. There must be a network connection between both computers. If there "
"are any firewalls between your computers they must have been configured "
"accordingly. Below is the information that you need to give to the other "
"person. Note that everybody who knows the password can connect, so be "
"careful. \n"
"For security reasons this invitation is only valid for one hour."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:51
msgid "Host (address and display):"
msgstr "Bediener (adres en vertoon):"

#: rc.cpp:52
msgid "Expiration time:"
msgstr "Vertreking tyd:"

#: rc.cpp:53
msgid "17:12"
msgstr "17:12"

#: rc.cpp:54
msgid "123456"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:55
msgid "cookie.tjansen.de:0"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:56
msgid "Password:"
msgstr "Wagwoord:"

#: _translatorinfo.cpp:1
msgid ""
"_: NAME OF TRANSLATORS\n"
"Your names"
msgstr "WEB-Vertaler (http://kde.af.org.za)"

#: _translatorinfo.cpp:3
msgid ""
"_: EMAIL OF TRANSLATORS\n"
"Your emails"
msgstr "frix@expertron.co.za"

